WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
reporting that I saw in liberal media was,

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.920
it seemed to suggest that I had deserved it

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:08.720
because they branded me far right.

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:11.360
And some even went so far as to suggest

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:14.080
that I maybe faked my injuries.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.559
A Buzzfeed reporter asked for my medical records,

00:00:16.559 --> 00:00:19.379
which I did provide, but this felt so,

00:00:20.959 --> 00:00:24.240
it's like, because I didn't die in that attack,

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:25.559
there was another round of people

00:00:25.559 --> 00:00:27.440
who wanted to finish me off.

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:30.120
But I continued, and then 2020,

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:32.320
Portland was really the epicenter

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:34.720
of the longest political violence.

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:37.799
Those months of riots, I was on the ground, undercover,

00:00:37.799 --> 00:00:39.520
and there was an assassination there.

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:42.919
There was a supporter of Donald Trump named Aaron Danielson

00:00:42.919 --> 00:00:45.599
who was shot dead by a self-described Antifa member

00:00:45.599 --> 00:00:47.360
who then fled out of state

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:49.599
and died in a shootout with US Marshals.

00:00:51.279 --> 00:00:53.959
In 2021, I returned undercover,

00:00:53.959 --> 00:00:56.639
naively thinking that enough time had passed,

00:00:56.639 --> 00:01:00.119
and was chased through the streets of downtown

00:01:00.119 --> 00:01:03.840
and beaten, nearly choked out.

00:01:05.239 --> 00:01:06.919
The person who was trying to choke me out

00:01:06.919 --> 00:01:10.480
held me so tightly that I had the blood,

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:12.440
the vessels in my eyes burst.

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:15.160
So one of the symptoms where my eyes were completely bread

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:17.239
after that, and I was hospitalized.

